{"text": "Thursday and Friday.\n\nOn Thursday morning, the bell rings. It is Mert.\n\n\"Good morning, Grandpa Kemal! Can I help with your phone?\"\n\nGrandpa is surprised. \"My phone? How do you know?\"\n\nMert's face is red. \"I hear the music. In the park.\"\n\nGrandpa thinks. Mert is not in the park on Wednesday.\n\n\"Come in,\" says Grandpa. \"Do you want tea?\"\n\nThey sit at the kitchen table. Mert takes the phone.\n\n\"Look, Grandpa. This is the camera. Touch here. Smile. Then touch Send.\"\n\nGrandpa tries. It is a good photo of Mert.\n\n\"I can do it!\" says Grandpa.\n\n\"Now, Ece calls you,\" says Mert. \"What do you do?\"\n\n\"I open the phone?\" asks Grandpa.\n\nMert laughs. \"No, Grandpa. You answer the phone. Touch the green button, not the red one.\"\n\nOn Friday, Grandpa tries again alone. Touch here. Smile. But then he touches something new.\n\nThere are many faces on the phone. Ece, her mum, her dad and Uncle Murat!\n\n\"Grandpa!\" they say. They look very surprised.\n\nGrandpa looks at the faces. Every face has a blue curtain behind it.\n\n\"Why is everything blue?\" asks Grandpa.\n\nEce laughs. \"Blue is a nice colour, Grandpa! Bye!\"\n\nThe faces go away.\n\nIn the evening, Grandpa sits at his window. Mert's flat is quiet now.\n\nGrandpa thinks about the week. A big cake. A lot of noise. Mert and the music. And blue, blue, blue.\n\nHe goes to bed early. Tomorrow is the big day. He can do it!\n\nOn Saturday morning, Grandpa wears his best shirt. He has yellow flowers for the photo.\n\nThen the bell rings.", "textSha256": "51b3ee62ec8d745f28fd7ece481c76eb587b1722d80336648c7ec0ad43668491", "voice_id": "EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL", "model_id": "eleven_v3", "speed": 0.9, "lang": "en", "parts": 1, "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "u", "r", "s", "d", "a", "y", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "F", "r", "i", "d", "a", "y", ".", "\n", "\n", "O", "n", " ", "T", "h", "u", "r", "s", "d", "a", "y", " ", "m", "o", "r", "n", "i", "n", "g", ",", " ", "t", "h", "e", " "